 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Guava, Yellow peach, Loquat, Pomelo\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           84小时的发酵感的差异会多一些番石榴，枇杷的感受，同时入口的酸感会更亮一些，加上饱满的果汁感受好香吃一些汁水很多的蜜柚，然后还会出现一些红色的莓果核果到果干的酸甜感，低温还会跑出来一丢丢的可可；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：黄色热带水果+柑橘+莓果核果果干\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这是我们这个产季开始接触的一个新的渠道/项目，为什么叫Highborn是这个项目的咖啡均来自Hambella区域下非常高海拔的小区域（2400米左右以及更高），处理站和小农信息暂时都出于渠道的商业考量对外保密；我们选了两个厌氧日晒批次，不同的发酵时长，72小时和84小时，其中72小时批次是今年ToH的实验处理组别的冠军批次；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RvM858VJdfkCkCCia1GbSnpmhZS65INfJ1hmRpsQe3vgLcnvXby7dVKgXon3mzmz2ZGRL1zf8Yn5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n<span>\n             关于这两只豆子\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这两只豆子均是来自于Oboleyancoffee公司旗下的高海拔地区的项目\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Horizon Bloom，旨在和Guji区域高海拔种植地区的小农合作，生产科溯源的小微批次，涵盖从品种，种植者，处理过程等生产全过程的追溯和精致的呈现保证最终的高品质出品；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4rGNP78cpVV1OMde6sdAEAFEEtLrIllGPjrbYAMNWYLed7rr9JQJ3k9lJjn5cnnNP79NicPYttmm4oVvPxts838nHNvTbtwut4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4JuyNbw1DiarNrwuTYicLOlabL75icksuysHGGhzykYLuHuicq72NIcianIoqpS1pp8vSw9d3yr2kpaJ1sMJvazA49KVghnR4ia3vfE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b441TOv9S5icBBkJYdNM7w4ab5knAwJKhBlJurX9Zia3oHbGVDj5m5qZPia77AqeicLW3ia2eqibQIBKPpCgQ5Wa7UdkwwwsDAZotH9c/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7qnqhCLYOVZRw5Mw2hpqa1dEYRSHfo10NnJ61q3Ucpz8HaibHVz9pU6PGucoNFI9zjmxY0C5dENrQv5OfQN7f4V71HqFU3gup8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           //一些Oboleyancoffee 官方Ins上的视频素材\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fmmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b4icOAlfsTnPhNE63Xafr5x3BUwOM1mC2k5KAoxt34sAJic0y7gO9n4cBVDkRFR2xVZTbp9EibILILFudpL5FfYWLz4pYNwNOu4yY%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4454452695768399874\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4454452695768399874\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b5vv8ZoCKvoRrNoqS8Dzjswib4DNE8ZfJeTekdo2Vuk0qAkibhODssMogq4iagSoA03h9DYhSCvNXRL0XvoQJTYfwObETg1N3foNo%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4454450186584817665\" data-ratio=\"1.7827298050139275\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4454450186584817665\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"1280\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fmmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b6MFicia96mBEkQtBPD49sTgESR6205sicCATDxvvLLc0PysYHibG41FfwwCGvWKt06uic22aeI8gUL9siaQ6rn26KZus687NmJ3aGXQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4454447029968011269\" data-ratio=\"1.7827298050139275\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4454447029968011269\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"1280\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#272727;font-family:Avenir Next, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n             关于这两个批次的处理信息\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;'>\n           72小时厌氧日晒 ～ ToH实验处理组别的冠军批次\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;'>\n           鲜果采收后在发酵罐里无氧条件下密封静置72小时发酵，然后拿出在晒床晾晒缓慢干燥；\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;'>\n           84小时厌氧日晒\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;'>\n           与72小时的发酵环境条件一致，只是延长了发酵时间；\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#272727;font-family:Avenir Next, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: